# Ghostty, Linux only — managed by chezmoi (~/Development/dotfiles). Loaded by config.ghostty.
# Alt already sends Alt on Linux, so fzf's Alt+C needs no setting. GNOME has no layer-shell, so
# the quick terminal and background blur are left out.

# Ghostty on the host with your tools in a distrobox: open every tab inside the box (set the
# box's name; `distrobox list` shows it). Not needed when Ghostty itself runs in the box.
# command = distrobox enter ubuntu-dev
